/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Ground truth for the ship catalogue (data/ships/ships.jsonc, from EDCD FDevIDs and
 * EDCD/coriolis-data). `count` pins the catalogue size; `records` pins identity,
 * manufacturer and landing-pad size (with `entitlement` present only on gated hulls);
 * `displayNameCorrections` pins installed English localisation readings from Elite
 * Dangerous 4.4.0.3, recorded 2026-08-14 UTC (no retained capture is available), and
 * `lookups` pins the case-insensitive symbol/name resolution the journal relies on.
 */
